  "id": "reasoning-test",
  "term": "reasoning test",
  "definition": "A reasoning test is an assessment designed to measure higher-order thinking, including abstract, verbal, mathematical, or visuo-spatial reasoning. It examines how well a person can use working memory in a controlled way to solve problems and draw conclusions.",
